# NOTE: src-tauri/resources/glass_advise_db.json IS committed — the oracle source
# it compiles from (standard_oracle_plus.json) is a gitignored 23MB Scryfall
# artifact absent in CI, so the compiled DB is the shippable source of truth.
# Regenerate + commit it when the card catalog changes (tools/build_and_test.sh
# recompiles + gates it via scripts/check_advise_db.sh).

